        <mxCell id="c42" value="• With &lt;font face=&quot;Consolas&quot;&gt;create root aggregate&lt;/font&gt; in the command (or a batch), &lt;b&gt;seven&lt;/b&gt; checks do nothing: the four root checks, &lt;font face=&quot;Consolas&quot;&gt;anonymous versions owned&lt;/font&gt;, both hash checks.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;font face=&quot;Consolas&quot;&gt;validate_memo_t&lt;/font&gt; caches only the three root gate checks. The Wizard replaces memo and checker together.&lt;br&gt;• The Wizard's own checks (&lt;font face=&quot;Consolas&quot;&gt;may_execute_wizard_command&lt;/font&gt;) are not in this graph." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fbfbfb;strokeColor=#cccccc;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#222222;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=2;spacingBottom=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="626" width="1900" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
